{
    "title": "2248 - Number Games 2048",
    "description": "<b>2248 - a twist on the classic 2048 & 4096 number blocks matching puzzle game!</b>\r\n\r\nPlay the puzzle solving number merge games that challenge your brain with 2248! In the challenging number puzzle games, players aim to merge number blocks to 1010, 1024, 1048, 2047, 2048, 2448, 4096 and ultimately reaching the elusive infinity tile!\r\n\r\nThe goal of these 2048 merge number games is to cube merge number blocks by swiping left, right, up, or down to combine two similar numbered blocks and create a higher number. Connect the same number cubes so they merge into higher numbers. The number block puzzle is easy to learn but difficult to master, making it a perfect choice for players of all ages. You get to enjoy these amazing new 2048 number blocks games while improving your memory, concentration levels and reflexes at the same time. In \"2248 - Numbers Game 2048,\" players aim for the elusive 4096 tile, strategically merging numbers like 2047, 2024,1010, and 1024 to showcase their numerical skills. Mastering these combinations is key to climbing the leaderboard and reaching the ultimate goal of the coveted 4096 tile.\r\n\r\nOnce you start playing it, you will absolutely get addicted to these 2248, and 4096 puzzle games. The block games are designed with beautiful graphics and intuitive gameplay, making it a great choice for those who love number block puzzle games.\r\n\r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY \u2192 2048 Number Blocks Match Puzzle Games</b>\r\n- Slide & connect the same number blocks in any of the eight directions (up, down, left, right or diagonally) to merge numbers.\r\n- Drag and Merge to drop the numbers\r\n- Get higher numbers when you merge multiple same numbers together.\r\n- Keep merging numbers to get the highest number possible.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES \u2192 2248: 1010, 1024, 1048, 2024, 2047, 2048, 4096 Match Numbers Games</b>\r\n- Play 1010, 1024, 1048, 2024, 2047, 2048, 4096 \u2192 2248 Numbers Game\r\n- Minimalistic & Elegantly designed game.\r\n- Smooth & simple controls.\r\n- Easy to learn and play\r\n- Automatic save game\r\n- Global Leaderboards\r\n- No time limits.\r\n\r\nWith 2248 number block puzzle 2048 games, you'll experience a unique and challenging number merge experience that is both engaging and fun. The number block puzzle gameplay is easy to understand, but the challenge comes from finding the right strategy to reach the highest number block tile. Enjoy hours of fun and entertainment with the free 1024 & 2048 number games, with endless possibilities for number match and block cube merging. Test your skills and strategy with the number block puzzle games, and see how far you can take your highest number, 2048. Get the 2248: 2048 Number Puzzle Games app now and start playing one of the most popular number merge games on the market!\r\n\r\nWith beautiful graphics and intuitive gameplay, 2048 & 2248 is a must-have app for anyone who loves number puzzle games. The number blocks are easy to see, and the drag and merge number mechanics are smooth and responsive. The game is free to play, and there are no hidden fees or in-app purchases. Download the 2248: 1024 & 2048 & 4096 Number Puzzle Games app today and start enjoying one of the most addictive number cube merge games on the market!\r\n\r\n\r\n- JOIN US ON FACEBOOK\r\nhttps://web.facebook.com/InspiredSquare\r\n\r\n- FOLLOW US ON TWITTER\r\nhttps://twitter.com/InspiredSquare\r\n\r\n- FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/squareinspired\r\n\r\n- DON\u2019T FORGET TO RATE US\r\nSend us your suggestions and feedback as we are always looking to add new levels and features!\r\n\r\nThe more you play, the more fun it becomes and you just cannot stop playing it. Try it today and enjoy this simple yet addictive puzzle game.\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Download 2248 Puzzle number games app for FREE and PLAY Now!\r\n\r\n<b>Enjoy,\r\n2248 PUZZLE TEAM.</b>\r\n\r\n*******\r\nPRIVACY POLICY: https://www.inspiredsquare.com/games/privacy_policy.html\r\n\r\nTERMS of USE: https://www.inspiredsquare.com/games/terms_service.html\r\n*******",
